        "linguistic"
      ],
      "text": "The grand inquisitor vows to bring down all the fury of a nation down upon their foes. Up to three lower-level allies within 60 feet of the grand inquisitor can use their reaction to Grapple, Strike, or Trip with a +2 status bonus.\n\nEffect: I Am the Law!"
